.TH LIBMPQ__BLOCK_CLOSE_OFFSET 3 2026-08-12 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__block_close_offset \- release an opened block offset table.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__block_close_offset("
.BI "        mpq_archive_s  *" "mpq_archive",
.BI "        uint32_t        " "file_number"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__block_close_offset\fP() to release the cached block offset table for a file.
.LP
The first argument is an archive handle opened by
\fBlibmpq__archive_open\fP(). The second argument, \fIfile_number\fP,
identifies the file whose table should be released.
.SH RETURN VALUE
On success, a zero is returned and on error one of the following constants.
.TP
.B LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST
File or block does not exist in archive.
.TP
.B LIBMPQ_ERROR_OPEN
The block offset table is not open.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__block_open_offset (3)
